{title: Sealed Until The End}
{subtitle: Daniel 12:4–13}
{key: Dm}
{tempo: 75}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] | [Dm] |
| [Dm] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
By the river two figures stood [Bb]
[Dm]One on each bank where the waters [Bb]flowed
One [Gm]asked the man in li[Dm]nen
How [Bb]long un[C]til the wonders [Dm]cease
He [Bb]raised his [C]hands to [Dm]heaven
[Bb]Swearing by the one [C]who lives for[Dm]ever
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
A [Bb]time times and [C]half a [Dm]time
Until [Bb]the power [C]of holy ones [Dm]is bro[Bb]ken
Sealed [C]until the [Dm]end
Many shall be [Bb]purified and made [Dm]clean [Am7/C][Dm][Am7/C]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]I heard but did not under[Bb]stand
[Dm]Asked my lord for the [Bb]outcome
The [Gm]words are closed and [Dm]sealed
Until the [Bb]time [C]of the [Dm]end
The [Bb]wicked shall [C]act [Dm]wickedly
[Bb]None of them [C]will under[Dm]stand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
A [Bb]time times and [C]half a [Dm]time
Until the [Bb]power of [C]holy ones is [Dm]broken
[Bb]Sealed un[C]til the [Dm]end
Many shall be [Bb]purified and made [Dm]clean [Am/C][Dm][Am/C]
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Bb]Daily [C]sacrifice taken a[Dm]way
[Bb]Abomina[C]tion of desola[Dm]tion set up
[Bb]One thousand [C]two hundred ninety [Dm]days
Blessed is [Bb]he who [C]waits for thirteen thirty [Dm]five [Am/C][Dm]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Bb]Go your [C]way until the [Dm]end
[Bb]You will [C]rest and [Dm]rise for your por[Bb]tion
{end_of_verse}

